ECO018,English,"What was the predecessor organization to NEPSE, established in 1976?","NEPSE (Nepal Economic Society) wasn’t founded as a separate entity in 1976. It evolved from earlier organizations focused on promoting investment and financial activities within Nepal. The first formal establishment of the Nepali Investment Company Limited (NEPS), which later became NEPSE, was in **1976**.

Therefore, the predecessor organization to NEPSE was the **Nepal Economic Society (NES)**.",Securities Exchange Center,,
