You can find more details about this program here: [https://www.nepalvisa.gov.np/](https://www.nepalvisa.gov.np/)",Online passport application system,,
TEC039,Nepali,नेपाली नागरिकहरूलाई व्यक्तिगत बायोमेट्रिक प्रमाणीकरणअघि अनलाइन राहदानी आवेदन दिन सक्षम पार्ने प्रणाली के हो?,"Nepal has implemented a system called ""Biometric Authentication for Online Travel Application"" (BATA) to enable citizens to apply for online travel permits through biometric verification. This system is designed to enhance security and streamline the application process.  Specifically, it involves using facial recognition technology to verify the identity of applicants before granting them access to travel permits.",अनलाइन राहदानी आवेदन प्रणाली,,
