TEC041,English,What is the name of Nepal's e-governance master plan aimed at digitizing government services?,Nepal’s e-governance master plan aims to digitize government services. The official name for this plan is **“Digital Nepal”**. It was launched in 2018 and focuses on enhancing digital governance through various initiatives. You can find more details about it here: [https://www.digitalnepal.gov.np/](https://www.digitalnepal.gov.np/),Digital Nepal Framework,,
